[[SECTION]]
UID: GSSC-MHLR-CONTENT-EDITORS
TITLE: Content Editor Requirements

[[SECTION]]
UID: GSSC-MHLR-PAGE-SECTION-EDITORS
TITLE: Pages and Sections

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: GSSC-MHLR-38
TITLE: Public Page Modification
STATEMENT: >>>
The GSSC Website Member Frontend SHALL let a member with the necessary permissions modify a public page without programming knowledge.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
Authorized members keep public pages current without developer intervention.
<<<
DERIVED: False
CHANGE_DRIVER: GSSC5-11
REVIEW_STATUS: Changed
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: GSSC-PIR-20
  ROLE: Refines

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: GSSC-MHLR-39
TITLE: Public Section Modification
STATEMENT: >>>
The GSSC Website Member Frontend SHALL let a member with the necessary permissions modify a section of a public page, including publication sections, without programming knowledge.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
Authorized members keep public page sections current without developer intervention. Publications are included as sections of public pages.
<<<
DERIVED: False
CHANGE_DRIVER: GSSC5-11
REVIEW_STATUS: Changed
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: GSSC-PIR-20
  ROLE: Refines

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: GSSC-MHLR-40
TITLE: Concurrent Different Page Edits
STATEMENT: >>>
The GSSC Website Member Frontend SHALL let members with the necessary permissions modify different public pages or sections at the same time.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
Simultaneous editing of different pages or sections keeps content work from serializing across the membership.
<<<
DERIVED: False
CHANGE_DRIVER: GSSC5-11
REVIEW_STATUS: Changed
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: GSSC-PIR-22
  ROLE: Refines

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: GSSC-MHLR-41
TITLE: Exclusive Page or Section Edit
STATEMENT: >>>
The GSSC Website Member Frontend SHALL limit modification of a given public page or section to one user at a time.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
The website does not resolve editing conflicts. One user at a time on a public page or section prevents lost changes.
<<<
DERIVED: False
CHANGE_DRIVER: GSSC5-11
REVIEW_STATUS: Changed
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: GSSC-PIR-22
  ROLE: Refines

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: GSSC-MHLR-42
TITLE: Edit Contention Feedback
STATEMENT: >>>
When another user already holds modification of a public page or section, the GSSC Website Member Frontend SHALL prevent a second user from modifying that same page or section and show that it is unavailable for modification.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
No Member Frontend PIR requires contention feedback. Exclusive edit needs a clear outcome for the second user so that user does not believe changes were accepted.
<<<
DERIVED: True
CHANGE_DRIVER: GSSC5-11
REVIEW_STATUS: Changed

[[/SECTION]]

